Package: runwaybar
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35)
Maintainer: Nitish Agarwal <1592163+nitishagar@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Your AI runway, at a glance — a featherweight Linux usage bar
 RunwayBar shows quota/runway for Claude Code, Codex, z.ai/ZCode, OpenCode
 and Muse Code
 in the system tray. Reads the tools' local credentials read-only; never
 writes, refreshes or transmits them anywhere except each vendor's own usage
 endpoint. Apache-2.0 licensed.
Homepage: https://github.com/nitishagar/runwaybar
